  "overview": "Survivor România is a Romanian reality game show based on the international Survivor format. The season premiered on 18 January 2020 on Kanal D.\n\nFollowing the basic premise of other international versions of the format, it features a group of contestants who are marooned in an isolated location, where they must provide food, water, fire, and shelter for themselves. The contestants compete in challenges for rewards and immunity from elimination. The contestants are progressively eliminated from the game until only one remains and is given the title of \"Sole Survivor\" and awarded the grand prize. The first two seasons's \"Sole Survivor\" received the prize of €50.000. By the third season, the prize for the winner got bumped up to €100.000.",
